      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHAOTIC BOY (5) steps out for the first time at this course. Filled the frame latest when second (19.70) at Angle Park off this draw. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Top prospect. BANDIT BLAZE (2) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 5th at Angle Park in Grade 4/5 company. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Likely to play a prominent role. YES EILEEN (1) finished third (19.96) two back at Angle Park but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Should be thereabouts. LIFE'S A JOURNEY (4) generally performs well here at this distance.",
